# What a build writes: Gradle's cache and outputs, the SDK path Android
# Studio records, and the native libraries `flui build android` copies in
# before packaging. The Gradle wrapper (`gradlew`, `gradle/wrapper/`) is
# source: its presence is what makes `flui build android` use Gradle.
/.gradle/
/build/
/app/build/
/app/src/main/jniLibs/
/local.properties

# Signing material.
key.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
